==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|eo}} ''[[rencontre]]''

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|renkont}}

# to [[meet]], to [[encounter]] ''(transitive)''
#: Bonas finfine '''renkonti''' vin!
#: ''It is good to '''meet''' you at last.''
#: Moseo '''renkontis''' Dion en formo de brulanta arbeto.
#: ''Moses '''encountered''' God in the form of a burning bush.''

